=2 Walkthrough
Use a certain number of {p:Imprimaturs|Imprimatur} and then speak to {n:Levil} in the {p:Pioneers' Coalition} to complete this Mission and start the next.
* The Imprimatur requirement can be fulfilled prior to this Mission, in which case the next Mission can be started on the next game day.
** You may continue this Mission by meeting a total of completing {p:Coalition Assignments} (measured by total Imprimaturs spent on them) along with achieving a certain level of {n:Adoulin Fame}.
*** 15 imps utilized + Fame 2 ({q:I'm on a Boat|I'm on a Boat|I'm on a Boat} / {q:Hide and Go Peak|Hide and Go Peak|Hide and Go Peak} / {q:Western Waypoints, Ho!|Western Waypoints, Ho!|Western Waypoints, Ho!} / {q:Wes...Eastern Waypoints, Ho!|Wes...Eastern Waypoints, Ho!|Wes...Eastern Waypoints, Ho!} / {q:The Old Man and the Harpoon|The Old Man and the Harpoon|The Old Man and the Harpoon}) is sufficient.

For quick coalition assignments:
* A quick and easy way to accomplish this is to farm/buy stacks of {i:Bloodthread|Bloodthread|1700} and simply repeat the **Gather Materials: Rala Waterways** Task in the {p:Inventors' Coalition}. All that is required is to accept the task, trade 3 Bloodthread to the {n:Task Delegator}, then talk to the Task Delegator again to finish. Rinse and Repeat!
* Another method is to do simple delivery assignments from the Couriers' Coalition. You can walk out to the waypoint, teleport to a bivouac and talk to the administrator for the delivery, and then come back to the Courier's guild for easy completions.

For quick repeatable-quest fame:
* {q:trio of repeatable quests|It Sets My Heart Aflutter|trio of repeatable quests} using item turn-ins. You may be able to find these on the AH in sufficient quantities to streamline this - setting your Home Point to HP#1 in Eastern Adoulin may also be helpful.

For general Adoulin quests to bolster your accomplishments in the area:
* {p:Adoulin Quests}

=3 Going Forward
* Continue using your Imprimaturs, as you'll need higher requirements for {M:a future mission|Seekers of Adoulin Mission 2-7-3|Yggdrasil}
* You can 'bank' them if you can't get to them by accepting assignments and then cancelling them later, as you get a full refund.
** Also if you're short on time, inventor's can be done fully with the AH, and Courier's can be done fully with waypoints.
* You'll need to be diligent about doing assignments to rank everything up to Legend if:
** you want to unlock {p:Ergon Weapons} ({p:GEO}'s {p:Idris} & {p:RUN}'s {p:Epeolatry} - very useful for those jobs)
** you want the {k:Golden shovel cordon}, the prerequisite for the {q:Adoulin epilogue|The Ygnas Directive|Adoulin epilogue} questline which rewards the ability to upgrade the player's chosen scenario ring to the +1 version ({i:example|Orvail Ring +1|26203}) and grants a special {p:healer trust|BGWiki:Trusts}.

